    "plot": "There is no conspiracy in the Test-Lab, and that is the point. Alex Vale has been hired as a QA expert for a single afternoon to walk through a small facility and confirm that its rooms, objects and conversations behave the way the manual says they do.\n",
    "rules": "",
    "intro_text": "Welcome to the Test-Lab!\n\nThis is not a story but a workbench: \nthe lab serves quality assurance and is a playground for the features of the TaleWeaver engine. Each room isolates one area so you can try it, break it and try it again.\n\nThe Conversation Hall is for NPC dialog, the Object Workshop for containers, locks, readable notes and crafting, and the Switch Lab for switches and the effects they trigger. The Combat Arena tests turn-based combat against passive sparring partners, and in the Teleportation Lab Professor Pip Fenwick is waiting to demonstrate scripted teleports.\n\nNothing here ends on its own. Explore in any order, and end the session whenever your tests are done.",
    "completed_condition": "The tester voluntarily finishes after exploring the lab.",
    "gameover_condition": "The protagonist is defeated in combat.",
