      "is_portable": true,
      "is_final_state": false,
      "inventory": [],
      "hp_change": 0,
      "stamina_change": 0,
      "mana_change": 0,
      "text_log_content": "My new apprentice is an idiot, so I am writing this down one last time before I turn him into a newt.\n\n1. The petrified toad fears fire. Keep it as far from the charred oak as the table allows!\n2. The clockwork heart needs a place at the very edge of the table, or its ticking cracks the centrepiece.\n3. The gambler's gold die lies directly to the left of the nightshade. Gambling and a quick death belong together.\n4. The heart's old mechanism stalls the moment dried herbs or loaded gold lie right",
      "text_log_format": "DOCUMENT"
    },
